  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "いっぽんあしを　じめんに　さして\nひのひかりを　たっぷり　あびると\nはなびらが　あざやかに　いろづく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "다리 하나를 땅에 꽂은 채\n햇빛을 잔뜩 받으면\n꽃잎이 선명한 색을 띠게 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "當牠把單腳紮進地面裡，\n並且沐浴充分的陽光，\n花瓣就會染上鮮豔的顏色。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand il plante son unique pied pour absorber\nla lumière du soleil, ses pétales prennent\nune couleur éclatante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Steckt es sein Beinchen fest in den Boden und\nbadet dann ausgiebig im Sonnenlicht, nimmt\nseine Blüte eine kräftigere Farbe an.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si planta su única extremidad inferior en la tierra\ny se expone a abundante luz solar, sus pétalos\ncobran un color vivo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando conficca il suo piede nel terreno e\nassorbe luce solare in abbondanza, il colore\ndei suoi petali diventa più intenso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It anchors itself in the ground with its single leg,\nthen basks in the sun. After absorbing enough\nsunlight, its petals spread as it blooms brilliantly.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "一本足を　地面に　刺して\n陽の光を　たっぷり　浴びると\n花びらが　鮮やかに　色づく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "当它把单脚扎进地面里，\n并且沐浴充分的阳光，\n花瓣就会染上鲜艳的颜色。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si planta su única extremidad inferior en la tierra\ny se expone a abundante luz solar, sus pétalos\ncobran un color vivo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "そよかぜで　くるくる　まわりながら\nたのしそうに　うたう　あいらしさに\nみせられ　そだてる　ひとが　おおい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "산들바람에 빙글빙글 돌면서\n즐겁게 노래하는 귀여운 모습에\n반해서 키우는 사람이 많다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會隨著微風一邊轉圈圈一邊\n愉快地唱歌。許多人因為喜歡\n這可愛的模樣而培育牠。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nombreux sont ceux qui ont décidé d’en élever\nun après avoir été charmés par sa manière\nde chanter en virevoltant au gré de la brise.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Viele Leute werden ihre Trainer, weil sie es\nniedlich finden, wie diese Pokémon in sanften\nBrisen herumwirbeln und voller Freude singen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Muchos los crían tras quedar prendados de lo\nadorables que resultan cuando cantan dando\nvueltas empujados por la brisa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Canta felice girando su se stesso mentre si lascia\ntrasportare dal vento. Molti ne allenano uno\nsemplicemente perché lo trovano adorabile.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It whirls around in the wind while singing a joyous\nsong. This delightful display has charmed many\ninto raising this Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "そよ風で　くるくる　回りながら\n楽しそうに　歌う　愛らしさに\n魅せられ　育てる　人が　多い。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会随着微风一边转圈圈一边\n愉快地唱歌。许多人因为喜欢\n这可爱的模样而培育它。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Muchos los crían tras quedar prendados de lo\nadorables que resultan cuando cantan dando\nvueltas empujados por la brisa.",
